===== Wireless - for Revision C3 =====

As the wlan chip is not starting up with a valid mac-address, the driver will not upload the chip's firmware image until there is a valid manual MAC configuration.

[[https://forum.openwrt.org/viewtopic.php?pid=367201#p367201|Adding mac-address for access-point mode]]. This fix only works for access-point mode, so e.g. scanning for WLANs won't work, since this is switching the unit to station mode.

